// Faster Ancient Stations — Palworld 1.0.3
//
// This patch makes every recipe currently exclusive to the Ancient Workbench
// or Ancient Furnace take one third of its vanilla WorkAmount (3x crafting speed).
// Shared recipes are deliberately untouched, so Advanced Workbench/other stations
// retain normal timings. Rebuild or update this list after a Palworld patch that
// changes which station a recipe belongs to.

